🔹 Step 3:
Select New Problem
🔹 Step 4:
Enter:
•	Number of Alternatives = 3
•	Number of States = 3
•	Select Uncertainty
🔹 Step 5:
Enter Payoff values in the matrix
🔹 Step 6:
Choose criteria:
•	Maximax
•	Maximin
•	Minimax Regret
•	Laplace
🔹 Step 7:
Click Solve
🔹 Step 8:
Observe results & optimal decision for each criterion
 
📌 RESULT / CONCLUSION
Different criteria give different decisions:
•	Optimistic → Large Plant
•	Pessimistic → Small Plant
•	Balanced & Regret-based → Medium Plant
Thus, decision depends on manager’s attitude toward risk.
 
