🔹 Step 6:
Enter payoff values in the table
🔹 Step 7:
Click Solve
🔹 Step 8:
Observe results:
•	EMV
•	EOL
•	EVPI
•	Best alternative
 
📌 RESULT / CONCLUSION
The optimal decision is Medium Advertisement as it gives:
•	Maximum Expected Monetary Value
•	Minimum Expected Opportunity Loss
Thus, Decision Theory under risk helps in selecting the best alternative using probability-based evaluation.
 